        "original_id": "0e7e112b-7772-5648-b62b-0991fe459a0c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tomáš Šmíd, Fabrice Santoro, Arnaud Clément\n- Places: Plzeň, Tahiti\n- Events: 1984 Bavarian Tennis Championships – Singles, 1999 Open 13 – Singles\n- Topics: tennis careers, tournament results\n\nFacts:\n- Tomáš Šmíd was born on May 20, 1956 in Plzeň.\n- Tomáš Šmíd is a former tennis player from Czechoslovakia.\n- Tomáš Šmíd won nine singles titles during his career.\n- Fabrice Vetea Santoro was born on December 9, 1972.\n- Fabrice Santoro is a retired French professional male tennis player from Tahiti.\n- Tomáš Šmíd was the defending champion at the 1984 Bavarian Tennis Championships – Singles, but he lost in the first round.\n- Fabrice Santoro defeated Arnaud Clément 6–3, 4–6, 6–4 to win the 1999 Open 13 singles competition.",
